# The viewer image (lessonforge/deploy/Dockerfile, built from this root by render.yaml) needs only these.
# Everything else stays out of the build context: the workspace, lessons, keys (.env), node_modules.
*
!lessonforge/pyproject.toml
!lessonforge/README.md
!lessonforge/src
!lessonforge/clients/lessonforge-app
lessonforge/clients/lessonforge-app/node_modules
lessonforge/clients/lessonforge-app/dist
lessonforge/clients/lessonforge-app/.expo
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.env
**/.env.*
